  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e14-scene-08",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "悄悄珍藏的心意  (Professor Fang's Approval and a Quiet Secret)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "fang": "方老师",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Professor Fang approves Bu Xiaogu's new thesis outline wholeheartedly. Outside Chun Yuqiao's door that evening, Xiaogu makes a quiet resolution—until Xingtian's chairwoman pulls her into an unexpected day off. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "新选题很好，我大力支持你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "太好了，感谢您，方老师，真的太谢谢您了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "方老师您多保重，方老师再见。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "本应该属于我的，都已在我手中。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不属于我的，就悄悄地珍藏起来吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "董事长？咱们去哪儿啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好，我先开出去再说。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不能让公司的人知道您出去了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我还得做好旷工一天的准备？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "要是主管问起我的话，就让他去找您！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "新选题很好，我大力支持你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Your new thesis topic is excellent; I back you wholeheartedly.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "太好了，感谢您，方老师，真的太谢谢您了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wonderful—thank you, Professor Fang, thank you so very much!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "方老师您多保重，方老师再见。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Please take good care of yourself, Professor Fang—goodbye!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "本应该属于我的，都已在我手中。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everything that rightfully belongs to me is now back in my hands.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不属于我的，就悄悄地珍藏起来吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And what does not belong to me, I will quietly treasure away in my heart.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "董事长？咱们去哪儿啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chairwoman? Where are we heading?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好，我先开出去再说。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright, I will drive us out of the car park first.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不能让公司的人知道您出去了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Nobody at the company can know that you slipped out?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我还得做好旷工一天的准备？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And I should be ready to skip a full day of work?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "要是主管问起我的话，就让他去找您！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If my supervisor asks where I am, I will send him straight to you!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "新选题很好，我大力支持你。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "太好了，感谢您，方老师，真的太谢谢您了！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "方老师您多保重，方老师再见。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "本应该属于我的，都已在我手中。",
      "gap": 0.5
